msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "diamond-matrix glass"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
