#. ~ Description of mission "The bounty is on Salus IV"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/missions/bounty_hunter_missions.json
msgid ""
"You've chased your bounty all the way to the ass end of the galaxy here in "
"the Salus system.  A place of so little value to UICA that it's left to "
"pirates and hermits.  While you don't know where exactly your bounty is in "
"this desolate wasteland you do have a lead on one of his associates.  Maybe "
"he'll be able to tell you where to go."
msgstr ""

