#. ~ Description of monster "brain blaster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go have set up some defenses here.  This horrifying techno-organic "
"amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On the"
" plus side it looks like an easy headshot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Regulator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is effectively an automated battle tank "
"designed for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile "
"launcher, a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's "
"designed to match the fervor of freedom fighters with the industrial might of"
" Earth."
msgstr ""

