#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Zenit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"An ancient security drone intended to safeguard extractive outposts in "
"hostile environments.  Its construction vaguely recalls an alien crustacean, "
"with a single sensory oculus and four spade-like legs mounted underneath a "
"disk of space-ship grade armor.  Zenit units can mount a wide variety of "
"\"deterrent\" weapon modules, and its difficult to tell what this rogue unit "
"is capable of."
msgstr ""

