#. ~ Description of monster "UICA Imaginifer MP"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"A supposedly non-combat refit of Wraitheon's Imaginifer series, outfitted for"
" crowd control and riot suppression.  This unit is outfitted with a beanbag "
"shotgun and a taser and has been painted in the white and blue scheme of "
"UICA's military police."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"Imaginifers are Wraitheon Industries standard military humaniforms, company parlance for an android designed to seamlessly integrate into standard infantry units.  Although originally designed for UICA's expeditionary forces they are now commonly employed by any faction that can afford them.  This particular unit seems to belong to the Company itself.\n"
"\n"
"Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"An imaginifer variant of unorthodox design, the Hashashiyyin dispenses with "
"most of its armor in favor of active-camo systems and a lightweight, more "
"agile frame.  Commonly employed in scouting and counter-sniping roles.  This "
"unit is equipped for close range ambush, and weilds a 35x50mm dart gun."
msgstr ""

