#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"A bulky aerial drone that mounts an advanced AI overwatch unit within it "
"bulbous carapace-like armor.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the "
"Isohypsa is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat "
"capabilities of simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."
msgstr ""

