#. ~ Description of monster "UICA Imaginifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
msgid ""
"Imaginifers are Wraitheon Industries standard military humaniforms, company parlance for an android designed to seamlessly integrate into standard infantry units.  This particular unit is currently equipped with light blue UICA livery and wields a SR-P77.  Its rugged design and technological sophistication make it far more formidable than the human soldiers its nominally meant to support.\n"
"\n"
"The Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
