#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthling"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mannerisms and accent are a dead giveaway that you were raised on Earth."
"  Whatever your thoughts about the homeworld might be, the simple fact that "
"you can call it home is likely to affect relationships with people liable to "
"care about such things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Local System Security"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Local System Security"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcement officer, with jurisdiction that "
"technically extends to the Salus System.  Whether you can find anyone who "
"that matters to is questionable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pinkerton"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pinkerton"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are an UICA affiliated private-security professional, with jurisdiction "
"that technically extends to the Salus System.  Whether you can find anyone "
"who that matters to is questionable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "MD"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a doctor who went out to space and has somehow ended up out on the "
"frontier in the Salus System.  At least out here you get a lot more hands on "
"life or death work compared to the core UICA worlds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rediscovered Tribal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rediscovered Tribal"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Some worlds maintained human life but lost technologically advanced "
"civilization.  As these worlds get rediscovered some organizations leave the "
"worlds to develop, while others see a source of cheap labor.  Whether you "
"snuck onto a ship or were Shanghaied onto one you've somehow ended up on the "
"hell that is Salus IV.  At least you have some experience surviving outside "
"of what these spacers call 'civilization'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "UICA Inspector"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "UICA Inspector"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a UICA Inspector from a civilized part of space.  You have the "
"authority to investigate under a variety of different legal frameworks, UICA,"
" planetary, corporate, system, pre-Discontinuity legal systems for worlds "
"that have only recently been re-discovered.  All of this means that you are "
"nearly a law unto yourself, though you wonder how much that matters in a "
"place like Salus IV outside of maybe Port Augustmoon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "UICA Astrographic and Gatepoint Agent"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "UICA Astrographic and Gatepoint Agent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"As a member of the Astrographic and Gatepoint Division you are responsible "
"for spreading the boundaries of the Frontiers and protecting interstellar "
"travel.  This gives you wide ranging latitude when it comes to addressing "
"threats to interstellar travel.  Does this technically make you a member of "
"UICA's very own secret police?  Yes, yes it does."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Radioactive Environment Adaptation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radioactive Environment Adaptation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You think you know how to instruct your body to process radioactive particles"
" out of itself faster than normal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Radiation Flush "
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiation Flush "
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can instruct your immune system to flush out radioactive particles at an "
"enviable speed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "fungivoral immune system"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "fungivoral immune system"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The immune system of these beings transcends anything seen in humanity and "
"appear to be able to target even directed infections such as fungal "
"infestations."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick Hide"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Hide"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has thickened and toughened further, acting as natural armor.  "
"Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rhomboidal Denticles"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rhomboidal Denticles"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has thick diamond shaped enamel scutes that both armor your body "
"and allow you to move more smoothly in water.  While difficult to penetrate, "
"it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

