msgstr ""

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
msgid "salvor fabricator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene "
"before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of "
"ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and near-"
"pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each been "
"meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm perched"
" on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, she "
"idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Gray hairs peek out"
" from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a "
"permanent scowl."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "[Approach the counter]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Great, another Earther descends from the heavens.  Did you come all the way "
"here to grace us with your presence?  If you've any brains in that thick "
"skull: you take whatever money you have left and get your sorry ass off this "
"rock.  Salus ain't for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "You got some kind of problem with Earthers?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Your kind are all the same.  Born on the ol' celestial throne Sol, silver "
"spoon in your mouth.  Everywhere you go, you're walk'n and talk'n like you "
"own the place.  Bumbling through the stars without a clue.  Spit'n out the "
"Corpo bullshit they been feeding you till you die for the glory of ol' Earth."
"  I've seen enough Earth kids come through here to know you type.  Here to "
"bite it just like they did?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "I didn't come here to die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Course you didn't.  But death's all you'll find here.  You step into those "
"icy wastes and you ain't wandering back.  A bot'll blow your brains out or a "
"Wraith splatter you into some many pieces that even the med bots can't put "
"your carcass back together.  And if you ain't lucky the moxies'll mob you.  "
"Now the way they tear a person apart, it ain't a sight that ever leaves you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Leaving isn't an option for me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Another new face.  So what'll it be this time?  Corpo Business?  Treasure "
"Hunting?  Bounty Hunt?  Or maybe you heard about the lovely weather here and "
"just had to experience it yourself?  Save yourself the trouble, there ain't "
"nothing for you on Salus.  Want my advice?  Get off world 'fore some bot "
"plasters your brains all over the snow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Whatever you think your reasons are they ain't worth it.  Salus'll chew you "
"up and spit you back out.  A quick death here is a mercy.  Get off world no "
"matter what it costs you: That's how you survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "I'm not backing down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Do you talk to all your customers like this?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and a small smile creases her lips.\n"
"So you got some spine, good.  Some of the kids that come through here fold the minute the pressure's on.  They don't have a damn clue what's waiting for them out there.  You, well come back alive and you can call me impressed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "So, what do you actually do here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and scoffs.\n"
"You don't have what it takes kid.  But I won't beat a dead horse.  If you're set on this: best you get geared up before you head out there.  Got some good stuff here that might save your life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"A small smile tugs at the edge of Veronica's lips.\n"
"Tch.  No, just the ones I like.  If you ain't changing your mind then at least take a look around.  Best not to go into those frigid wastes unprepared."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Right then, this here's my shop, and round the back there's my workroom.  "
"I've enough tech here to whip up whatever you need, 'cept for that real fancy"
" glittertech shit.  I sell the sorts of tools folk like you need to do your "
"work.  Stuff that'll get you into places you ain't supposed to be and break "
"apart anything interesting you find.  I'll buy any scraps you get out there "
"and I'll shoot you straight on the prices.  So if you find anything "
"interesting you bring it here first ya hear?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Good to know.  Can I take a look at your stock?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Good to know.  I don't need anything right now though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Welcome back.  Planning on buying something or did you just come here to "
"gawk?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Show me what you have in stock."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "What brought you to Salus?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Came in with a crew trying to cozy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan "
"from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see "
"the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the"
" graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "What happened to your crew?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Did you ever find anything interesting?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"They're pushing daisies in the great beyond.  Not a single one of them made "
"it off this hell.  Not like I didn't warn them.  They just kept fooling "
"around in places one of us had any business being."
msgstr ""
